      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "inlet-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 238,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "text": "Conductors A and B. On a reversible inlet\n(Type L, Schuko) neither is reliably Live,\nso BOTH are switched — never \"L only\".",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "tbun-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 476,
      "y": 238,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "text": "One terminal block per net. A WAGO 221-413\njoins all three of its ports into one net, so it is\nnot a terminal strip and never a barrier.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "k1-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 248,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "text": "Main poles must be rated for the COMBINED\ncold-start inrush, not the steady-state current:\nthe LRS-50-12 alone specifies 45 A at 230 VAC.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ps15-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1210,
      "y": 302,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "text": "Three conductors: +15 V, 0 V/COM, −15 V.\nCOM is the galvo driver's signal reference\nand bonds into the common ground.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "pe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 352,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "text": "PE  ─────  never switched, never fused  ─────►  both supply PE terminals  ·  enclosure  ·  laser chassis  ·  galvo head and driver chassis",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "lhead",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 398,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "text": "12 V BRANCH — from the switched 12 VDC supply above",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-30T09:57:49.475Z",
      "version": 1
    },
